# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# BrainIR .gitignore
# Principle: code, docs, research notes and small machine-readable
# manifests are versioned; bulk data, caches, secrets are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Data (bulk, regenerable or downloadable) ----
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/manifests/
data/manifests/*.tmp
*.feather
*.parquet
*.arrow
*.ipc
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.npz
*.npy
*.zarr/
*.n5/
*.swc
*.partial
*.parts.json
# small, reviewed test fixtures are the only exception ...
!tests/fixtures/**
# ... and the frozen public benchmark bundles (a few MB; their hashes are in benchmarks/dng100/BENCHMARK_LOCK.json)
!benchmarks/dng100/public/**/*.parquet
!benchmarks/dng100/public_blind/**/*.parquet

# ---- Secrets / credentials / sessions ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.token
*token*.txt
*.secret
*secrets*
*credentials*
.neuprint*
neuprint_token*
*.pem
*.key
cookies*.txt
*.har

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.pyd
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.python-eggs/
pip-wheel-metadata/

# ---- Tooling caches ----
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.cache/
*.log
logs/
tmp/
scratch/

# ---- OS / editor ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ---- Phase 2 bulk results: full per-run records are committed gzipped (<label>.json.gz); summaries/markdown stay plain ----
research/phase2/tournament/*.json
!research/phase2/tournament/*_summary.json
!research/phase2/tournament/*_curve.json
!research/phase2/tournament/cmp_*.json

# blind-evaluation run records keep the runner's captured absolute output paths; the hash is in FROZEN.json and a
# path-redacted copy (run_record_redacted.json) is committed instead (rule: no absolute paths in git)
research/phase2/blind_eval/*/runs/run_record.json

# ---- Phase 3: reference-result caches of the tournament / Level C (recomputable) ----
research/phase3/tournament/_refcache/
research/phase3/level_c/_refcache/
research/phase3/reviews/F_scratch/
